# No agent test scripts in commits

Never stage or commit throwaway verification/smoke scripts created during agent work.

Examples (do **not** commit):
- `server/scripts/_test_*.js`
- `server/scripts/_trace_*.js`
- Ad-hoc scripts named for a one-off check (phase smoke, bind probes, etc.)

Keep them local for debugging, or delete when done. Prefer running checks without adding files to git.

Product/migration scripts that are intentional project tooling are fine when the user asks for them explicitly.
